1
00:00:44,360 --> 00:00:46,400
This is...

2
00:01:01,800 --> 00:01:03,160
So many human organs.

3
00:01:03,800 --> 00:01:06,360
What exactly is Yungong Pavilion doing?

4
00:01:08,660 --> 00:01:10,660
How dare you trespass into
the forbidden area of Yungong Pavilion!

5
00:01:10,660 --> 00:01:11,960
You're courting death!

6
00:01:11,960 --> 00:01:12,760
Girl.

7
00:01:17,260 --> 00:01:18,860
Mister.

8
00:01:18,860 --> 00:01:20,930
Am I dreaming?

9
00:01:21,330 --> 00:01:22,060
Girl,

10
00:01:22,060 --> 00:01:23,960
wake up. You can't sleep.

11
00:01:31,600 --> 00:01:33,300
The secret chamber must not be exposed.

12
00:01:33,300 --> 00:01:34,600
So no matter who it is,

13
00:01:34,759 --> 00:01:36,100
they must be silenced.

14
00:01:36,500 --> 00:01:37,160
Master Yan,

15
00:01:37,229 --> 00:01:38,400
you asked for this.

16
00:01:42,560 --> 00:01:42,860
You

17
00:01:43,300 --> 00:01:44,360
are not a mortal.

18
00:01:45,300 --> 00:01:48,400
Hand over the antidote
if you don't want to die.

19
00:01:50,729 --> 00:01:51,100
Only

20
00:01:51,460 --> 00:01:53,300
the Pavilion Master
can concoct the antidote.

21
00:01:53,300 --> 00:01:54,259
He is out on a tour

22
00:01:54,300 --> 00:01:55,700
and hasn't returned yet.

23
00:01:58,930 --> 00:02:00,460
What's wrong with you guys?

24
00:02:00,560 --> 00:02:02,800
Didn't I give her
the poison-repelling bead?

25
00:02:02,800 --> 00:02:04,600
How could she still be poisoned?

26
00:02:04,730 --> 00:02:05,860
Senior Medical Maniac,

27
00:02:05,860 --> 00:02:06,900
it's all my fault.

28
00:02:07,000 --> 00:02:08,460
Please check on her first.

29
00:02:12,900 --> 00:02:14,560
If there is no antidote for this poison,

30
00:02:14,560 --> 00:02:16,530
she will definitely die in three days.

31
00:02:16,530 --> 00:02:18,700
But I think you can also see

32
00:02:18,960 --> 00:02:20,800
that there is a mysterious power
in her body

33
00:02:20,800 --> 00:02:22,200
neutralizing the toxin.

34
00:02:22,400 --> 00:02:22,900
So,

35
00:02:23,030 --> 00:02:24,300
she will be fine.

36
00:02:24,660 --> 00:02:26,000
If I'm not mistaken,

37
00:02:26,760 --> 00:02:27,930
that's very likely

38
00:02:28,300 --> 00:02:29,300
the power of Nuwa.

39
00:02:34,560 --> 00:02:36,460
It is precisely because of this power

40
00:02:36,460 --> 00:02:38,800
that I once thought of
leaving her to fend for herself.

41
00:02:38,800 --> 00:02:40,829
But when she was truly hurt,

42
00:02:41,600 --> 00:02:42,200
I...

43
00:02:47,700 --> 00:02:49,800
Just because she possesses
the power of Nuwa,

44
00:02:49,800 --> 00:02:51,329
I hurt her like this.

45
00:02:51,860 --> 00:02:53,660
But when has she ever harmed me?

46
00:02:55,000 --> 00:02:55,800
Girl,

47
00:02:56,500 --> 00:02:57,860
who exactly are you?

48
00:02:58,660 --> 00:03:00,130
What should I do with you?

49
00:03:13,660 --> 00:03:14,860
This is

50
00:03:15,400 --> 00:03:16,400
the Qi Residence.

51
00:03:20,200 --> 00:03:21,460
My Lady, you're awake.

52
00:03:21,600 --> 00:03:23,530
My master has been waiting for you.

53
00:03:24,230 --> 00:03:26,060
I can finally meet my savior.

54
00:03:30,800 --> 00:03:31,430
Hello,

55
00:03:31,700 --> 00:03:33,100
are you the master of the Qi Residence?

56
00:03:33,100 --> 00:03:34,530
I heard that you saved...

57
00:03:37,060 --> 00:03:39,200
What? Haven't seen me for a few days

58
00:03:39,230 --> 00:03:40,760
and you don't recognize me?

59
00:03:40,900 --> 00:03:41,860
It's actually

60
00:03:41,860 --> 00:03:42,860
you.

61
00:03:44,060 --> 00:03:44,860
That's right.

62
00:03:45,260 --> 00:03:46,500
I'm now called Qi Yan.

63
00:03:48,700 --> 00:03:50,430
Master Yan,

64
00:03:50,430 --> 00:03:52,630
I will keep your
life-saving grace in mind.

65
00:03:52,630 --> 00:03:53,760
What did you call me?

66
00:03:53,900 --> 00:03:55,460
I won't stay and bother you anymore,

67
00:03:55,460 --> 00:03:57,260
nor will I reveal your identity.

68
00:04:00,900 --> 00:04:02,930
Stop right there. I just saved you,

69
00:04:02,930 --> 00:04:04,860
and you're leaving just like that?

70
00:04:07,700 --> 00:04:09,030
Then kill me.

71
00:04:09,060 --> 00:04:10,920
I'll just return this life to you.

72
00:04:13,360 --> 00:04:15,100
I thought I had set up a protective seal,

73
00:04:15,100 --> 00:04:16,700
thought everything was under control.

74
00:04:16,700 --> 00:04:18,230
But your injury is real.

75
00:04:18,430 --> 00:04:20,890
You thought my giving up on you
was also real.

76
00:04:24,230 --> 00:04:26,300
About Black Wind Fort, I was wrong.

77
00:04:26,300 --> 00:04:27,460
You can hate me,

78
00:04:27,460 --> 00:04:28,430
or you can leave.

79
00:04:28,500 --> 00:04:30,260
But I beg you to stay for three days,

80
00:04:30,260 --> 00:04:31,760
until the poison is completely cleared.

81
00:04:31,760 --> 00:04:34,530
In three days, wherever you want to go,
I will escort you.

82
00:04:34,530 --> 00:04:36,860
Mister, you being so reasonable
all of a sudden

83
00:04:36,860 --> 00:04:37,930
scares me a little.

84
00:04:38,460 --> 00:04:39,659
I am not used to it either.

85
00:04:39,659 --> 00:04:41,990
Then hold it in.
Do not go back on your word.

86
00:04:43,130 --> 00:04:45,500
Stay. Not to be my anyone,

87
00:04:45,930 --> 00:04:46,990
but to be yourself.

88
00:04:47,730 --> 00:04:48,560
Are you sure?

89
00:04:48,760 --> 00:04:49,930
If I am myself,

90
00:04:50,030 --> 00:04:51,560
the first thing I will do is scold you.

91
00:04:51,560 --> 00:04:52,230
Scold me.

92
00:04:52,230 --> 00:04:53,030
Bastard!

93
00:04:54,100 --> 00:04:54,900
I will take it.

94
00:04:55,300 --> 00:04:56,230
Old monster!

95
00:04:56,630 --> 00:04:57,630
Not that one.

96
00:05:00,960 --> 00:05:01,760
Girl,

97
00:05:02,730 --> 00:05:04,660
I can wait for you to trust me again.

98
00:05:08,700 --> 00:05:09,760
I am hungry.

99
00:05:12,330 --> 00:05:13,590
What do you want to eat?

100
00:05:14,130 --> 00:05:14,960
A lot.

101
00:05:16,130 --> 00:05:17,390
Qi Manor can afford it.

102
00:05:18,830 --> 00:05:20,330
My savior treating me to a meal

103
00:05:20,330 --> 00:05:22,130
does not mean I have no backbone.

104
00:05:26,300 --> 00:05:27,130
Bastard.

105
00:05:27,600 --> 00:05:28,630
I cannot believe his bathhouse has

106
00:05:28,630 --> 00:05:30,430
so many things women like to use.

107
00:05:32,530 --> 00:05:33,360
Then again.

108
00:05:33,900 --> 00:05:35,130
Young Master Yan of Qiong City,

109
00:05:35,130 --> 00:05:36,330
Master of the Yan Sect,

110
00:05:36,330 --> 00:05:37,830
how could he lack women?

111
00:05:43,230 --> 00:05:45,360
He actually apologized to me just now.

112
00:05:45,960 --> 00:05:47,230
Could it be...

113
00:05:47,800 --> 00:05:50,159
So annoying, what on earth am I thinking?

114
00:05:56,000 --> 00:05:58,700
No, I cannot stay and let him bully me.

115
00:06:07,600 --> 00:06:08,660
Since I am leaving,

116
00:06:08,800 --> 00:06:10,800
men's clothes are definitely
more convenient.

117
00:06:10,800 --> 00:06:11,730
Little one,

118
00:06:12,260 --> 00:06:13,430
we meet again.

119
00:06:19,460 --> 00:06:21,760
So you are Young Master Yan's
male favorite in Qi Manor.
